    "updated_at": "2026-07-02T11:23:52Z",
    "body": "> will add more but as a starting point it's only set to true in https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#scheme-state step 2 step 9\n\nThanks. Working back from there I was able to surmise that a URL has an opaque path if it does not have an authority and its path does not begin with a slash. The test suite would seem to suggest that's the case, anyway.",
