    "created_at": "2026-07-20T21:22:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-20T21:22:39Z",
    "body": "Oh yes, the definition of Opaque Path has caused me a lot of confusion during my implementation which led me to re-design APIs of the parsing and a whole lot of re-designing on how I should handle opaque paths.\n\nHaving wasted a lot of time implementing it, and yet still I don't know what an opaque path even is; for me it's just a path in the parsing that we have to take and we have to know that we have taken it.\n\n",
